ng down random  baddies tell me that's not different  this is basically how it's worse than  John wick to me like look at this  choreography and now look at this what  is much more clever and one isn't don't  get me wrong the action is still good  the gunplay just gets too repetitive by  the end of the movie in comparison the  first action scene was genuinely great  because I had a lot of variety it the  movie resumed to have this level of  creativity in action then it would feel  more fresh and fun another small point  as to how the movie is bland is the look  at the movie I don't know why people in  Hollywood think that Bangladesh is  yellow it's as if I'm watching a movie  in a yellow [ __ ] of sunglasses to me it  just looks visually uninteresting and  it's kind of immersion breaking because  of how unnatural it looks having this  dull look in your film kind of just puts  a bland aura over the whole movie but  yeah these are just some of the reasons  why I didn't like the movie I think it's  pretty overrated given it's getting  relatively good reviews the action can  be enjoyable but it's just an insult to  me just how bland everything comes off  and how little the effort was put into  the writing especially since Joe Russo  was a director on Avengers so in that  sense I gave it a 2 out of 5 on  letterboxed so yeah this was my first  video review so thank you guys for  watching the whole thing I will  occasionally do more reviews on this  channel since I want to do more creative  content I also have the link to letter  box in the description if you guys are  interested hopefully you guys enjoyed  the video and have a nice day
 

